  "idea": "Cyberchef: the swiss army knife for data conversion and formatting",
  "text": "The free browser tool that solves fifty different data headache problems in seconds. Cleaning messy exports often forces you to manually reformat dates, unescape URLs, and strip broken characters. A single misplaced delimiter or corrupted timestamp can break database imports and halt your entire pipeline. CyberChef provides drag-and-drop recipes that automate regex extraction, hashing, and decoding in one continuous chain. You fix corrupted datasets in thirty seconds.",
